cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "pyhs3: pure-Python HS3 implementation with tensors and autodiff"
abstract: "pyhs3 is a pure-Python implementation of the HEP Statistics Serialization Standard (HS3), building statistical models as PyTensor computation graphs with autodiff support."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Stark"
    given-names: "Giordon"
    email: "kratsg@gmail.com"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/scipp-atlas/pyhs3"
url: "https://pyhs3.readthedocs.io/"
keywords:
  - HS3
  - HEP
  - statistics
  - pytensor
  - autodiff
